---
title: Bhuna Masala
# servings:
yield: 110%oz
tags:
  - ingredient
source:
  name: Myself
  # url: 
introduction: a base masala to fry and add spices too for various dishes.
---

Melt @ghee{3%oz} in a #pressure cooker{} pot.

Add @onions{56%oz}(chopped), @tomatoes{56%oz}(canned), @ginger-garlic paste{3%oz}.

Blend with an #immersion blender{} to get rid of any big solids (they can cause overheating in the pot).

Pressure cook on high for ~{45%min} and allow a natural release.

Once cooled, use an #immersion blender{} to blend until smooth.

Freeze or refrigerate.

When time to use, fry the mixture for a bit before cooking your ingredients.